":1,"episode":3,"released":"2025-05-29T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"As Raj stays in custody, Madhav's team digs deeper, uncovering new suspects. Meanwhile, Gauri intensifies her hunt for the weapon, but complications arise.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/e4FwdhZSIbIt6XnKmULaVkcG0Js.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAyNS9DcmltaW5hbC1KdXN0aWNlLUEtRmFtaWx5LU1hdHRlci0yMDI1Lw.1.4","title":"Domino Effect","season":1,"episode":4,"released":"2025-06-05T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"While Madhav uncovers a new lead at Roshni's funeral, Gauri uncovers secrets about Roshni. Lekha Agastya takes over as the prosecutor, and Anju takes matters into her own hands.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/tDctbJrDUyJThad3pLElyq5retD.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAyNS9DcmltaW5hbC1KdXN0aWNlLUEtRmFtaWx5LU1hdHRlci0yMDI1Lw.1.5","title":"Trauma Flashback","season":1,"episode":5,"released":"2025-06-12T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Kamala's memories reveal a new clue, giving Lekha the upper hand. As husband and wife face off in court, Madhav scrambles to defend Raj with mounting evidence against him.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/8JSSSRMiznR3puYPHZovSt66oSQ.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAyNS9DcmltaW5hbC1KdXN0aWNlLUEtRmFtaWx5LU1hdHRlci0yMDI1Lw.1.6","title":"Sins of the Privileged","season":1,"episode":6,"released":"2025-06-19T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"With 2 days to prepare, Madhav faces Kamala on the stand. Lekha changes tactics with a surprise witness. Her closing argument casts doubt on the Nagpal family, pushing Madhav to the edge.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/keZJz1eiA5a9ml4SlCnv6s1f6HW.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAyNS9DcmltaW5hbC1KdXN0aWNlLUEtRmFtaWx5LU1hdHRlci0yMDI1Lw.1.7","title":"The Missing Link","season":1,"episode":7,"released":"2025-06-26T00:00:00